            "<p>Celebrated on Diwali night; equally important in WB; especially in Kolkata</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Rath Yatra</strong></p>",
            "<p>Huge celebration in Mahesh (Serampore, Hooghly) — oldest in India; and Puri-style in WB</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Poila Boishakh</strong></p>",
